    "extract": "The Geological Museum of the Barcelona Seminary is a natural history museum situated inside the Barcelona Conciliar Seminary in Barcelona. The museum was established in 1874 and works to promote the study and better understanding of paleontology. \nThe Museu Geològic del Seminari de Barcelona specialization is fossilised invertebrates from different geological periods.",
    "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Geological Museum of the Barcelona Seminary</b> is a natural history museum situated inside the Barcelona Conciliar Seminary in Barcelona. The museum was established in 1874 and works to promote the study and better understanding of paleontology. \nThe Museu Geològic del Seminari de Barcelona specialization is fossilised invertebrates from different geological periods.</p>"
